## ✅ Architecture Decisions (Locked)

| Question | Decision | Impact |
|---|---|---|
| GPU Support | CPU-only Phase 2, optional GPU in Phase 5 | No CUDA deps until Phase 5 |
| Model Bundling | Download on first-run (~465MB) | Lean installer, phased UX |
| Face Clustering | Incremental nearest-centroid assignment | Memory-safe, O(n_new × n_clusters) |
| Image-to-Image Search | Reuse stored FAISS vector (< 1ms lookup) | Skip 100–200ms CLIP re-encode |
| Platforms | Windows Phase 5, Mac/Linux as Phase 5.1 follow-up | NSIS installer, Windows-first |

