#### Search Merge Logic
```python
# Image-to-image search: reuse stored FAISS vector (< 1ms)
def search_similar(image_id: int, k: int = 20):
    faiss_id = db.get_faiss_id(image_id)          # From embeddings_map table
    vec = faiss_store.reconstruct(faiss_id)        # faiss.index.reconstruct()
    ids, scores = faiss_store.search(vec, k)
    return ids, scores                             # No CLIP re-encode needed
```

