## ⚠️ Known Risks (Mitigated)

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| RAM spike during face loading | Incremental cluster assign — never load all embeddings |
| FAISS IVFFlat needs training (10K+ vectors) | Start with FlatL2; switch to IVFFlat after threshold |
| PyInstaller + open-clip import issues | Use `--collect-all open_clip` flag |
| Watchdog missing rapid file changes | SHA-256 check on re-scan catches any missed events |
| EXIF GPS absent on many phone photos | Graceful fallback: store NULL, skip geocoding |
